            <dd class="ledger__def">
              <p>&ldquo;I worked for Ryan as I shifted from agency to brand-side marketing. He taught me the ropes of building and managing a content strategy, navigating the differences between agency and brand-side life, and the value of being intimately acquainted with both high-level messaging and a product portfolio. His mentorship was invaluable to my success at Mitel, and I've taken those lessons with me in my current role. He's an adept practitioner, a compelling leader, and a value-add to any team looking for someone to elevate their marketing org.&rdquo;</p>
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger__row">
            <dt class="ledger__term">Saad Abughazaleh</dt>
            <dd class="ledger__def">
              <p>&ldquo;I have known and worked with Ryan for half a decade and in that time, he excelled beyond any measurable metric at everything he did. Ryan had a way to bring products to life such that lead generation and business development became seamless with the target audience's needs and expectations. Ryan also understood how to create easily digestible content that resonated with its reader, without being cumbersome in length and complexity. In short, Ryan knew who he was speaking to and how to speak with them. This extended to his presentation and management ability, taking a measured approach when collaborating with others outside his team. He would work to understand the different lines of business and how they come together so that he and his team could best support their stakeholders. This made him not only invaluable but also very enjoyable to work with.&rdquo;</p>
            </dd>
